  artifactName: Jabir's Alchemy Flask
  era: "Islamic Golden Age \xB7 800 CE"
  description: "Jabir ibn Hayyan, known as the Father of Chemistry, was the first
    scientist to use experiments to understand the world. He invented distillation,
    filtration, and crystallization \u2014 techniques chemists still use today in
    every laboratory around the world!"
  funFact: "Jabir invented so many chemicals that the word 'gibberish' comes from
    his name \u2014 because his writings seemed mysterious to Europeans!"
